# Append-only logs: on a local `git merge`, keep both sides' new lines instead of conflicting.
# Verified 2026-10-15 with two test branches: both entries kept, no markers, no duplicated lines.
# Limits:
#  - both versions of a line edited on both sides are kept silently;
#  - a blank separator line can be lost;
#  - GitHub's web mergeability check may not use this.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
docs/state/trial.md merge=union
